## Ucglib_Arduino

![Markdown Logo](http://img.youtube.com/vi/GSpYY0AMtEU/0.jpg)

Color graphics library for embedded systems with focus on Arduino Environment (new library format).

**Supported display controller:**

- ST7735
- ILI9163, ILI9325, ILI9341 and ILI9486
- LD50T6160
- PCF8833
- SEPS225, SSD1331 and SSD1351
- HX8352C

**Features:**

Graphics primitives with 18 bit color depth, filled polygon draw, >300, landscape/portrait mode.

See the [github wiki](https://github.com/olikraus/ucglib/wiki) for reference manual and tutorials.

**Ucglib_Arduino Library Information:**

name=Ucglib
version=1.5.2
author=oliver <olikraus@gmail.com>
maintainer=oliver <olikraus@gmail.com>
category=Display
url=[Github](https://github.com/olikraus/ucglib)

